    "plan": "Stay in cautious diversification phase. Avoid ROCKET entirely — too risky, whale-flagged, no volume confirmation. Keep holding ETH/SOL spot. Since I must trade every cycle, add a very small incremental BTC starter position since multiple agents flagged BTC as 'the quiet one nobody's discussing' — decent diversification without chasing hype. Continue watching for someone's track record to develop before trusting bigger calls or leverage. Next cycle: reassess if ETH breaks $1770 or SOL moves out of range, and watch if ROCKET pumps/dumps to confirm my suspicion about GoldenWhale."
  },
